

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@authToken = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Archival record preview - search
POST {{baseUrl}}/archival-config/salesforce/preview
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "orgId": "",
  "objName": "",
  "fields": [],

  "limit": 50,
  "page": 1
}

### Archival record preview - record detail
POST {{baseUrl}}/archival-config/salesforce/record-detail
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "orgId": "your-org-id",
  "objName": "Account",
  "recordId": "001xx000003DGb2AAG",
  "fields": ["Id", "Name"]
}



